   "The 'outperforming all previous single models' claim is falsified by a related single model reporting 28.4 BLEU on the same benchmark; the paper compares only against ConvS2S and GNMT.",
   "The 3x speedup is relative to the authors' own in-house LSTM baseline, not to ConvS2S/GNMT, so the comparison is not benchmarked against published systems.",
